fo/1024/1920.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>国科大杭高院环境学院</span><span>2025年优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动通知</span></span></a></p><p><span></span><br/></p></td>\n<td><p><span></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/3e700620ee9e361e6592.png\"/></p><p><span><span>群号：</span><span>463815886</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>宋</span></span><span><span>老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>0571-86080596</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>分子医学院</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><a href=\"http://hias.ucas.ac.cn/fzyxy/info/1065/1782.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span></span></a></p><p><span><a href=\"http://hias.ucas.ac.cn/fzyxy/info/1065/1782.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">国科大杭州高等研究院分子医学院 2025年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营报名通知</a></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/68004cbff02a605bbb4c.png\"/></p><p><span><span>群号：</span><span>818248830</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>滕</span></span><span><span>老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>0571-86080513</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>智能科学与技术学院</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span></span></p><p><a href=\"http://hias.ucas.ac.cn/znkxyjs/info/1055/1822.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>国科大杭州高等研究院智能科学与技术学院</span><span>2025年大学生暑期夏令营（线下）报名通知</span></span></a></p><p><span></span><br/></p></td>\n<td><p><span></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/91e5dfed6eab6456fa5f.png\"/></p><p><span><span>群号：</span><span>1015238753</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>倪</span></span><span><span>老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>0571-86085751</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p><strong><span><span>扫码进群即视作预报名成功，后续各学院确定夏令营举办具体信息后将正式发布报名链接，请及时关注群内消息以及各学院信息发布渠道</span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>五、</span><strong><span><span>往年夏令营精彩瞬间</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>一）往年夏令营图片</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span><span>院士讲座</span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/27900c39eadd2f7ae718.png\"/></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/7e47a0e984a7739f3037.png\"/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span><span>参观实验室并与科研人员面对面交流</span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/90185e8ae13776829f27.jpg\"/></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/0e2e6dff256dd7d39b4e.jpg\"/></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/c7f1dbb38b8918ce6392.jpg\"/></p>\n<p><span>3.</span><span><span>营员合影</span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/97bf820dbefb1fdd8cb4.png\"/></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/376230b5bbba4466bc6b.png\"/></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/db265f04491aca9c4623.png\"/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）</span><span>2024年夏令营微信公众号相关推文</span></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9mueTO154i65m_Qfe3WpDg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>格物筑梦</span>-基础物理与数学科学学院2024年优秀大学生暑期夏令营圆满结束</span></span></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/bG_CIATwcU4WtOw9cOTE7Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>物望所归</span> <span>追光未来</span><span>——物理与光电工程学院2024年优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动圆满成功</span></span></span></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://hias.ucas.ac.cn/life/info/1437/1996.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>“生命”值得期待——生命学院2024年优秀大学生暑期夏令营圆满收官</span></span></span></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"http